  "Install Music Assistant and its Home Assistant integration for playlists, albums, and skipping on every speaker.": ["Installiere Music Assistant und seine Home-Assistant-Integration für Playlists, Alben und Überspringen auf allen Lautsprechern.", "Instala Music Assistant y su integración para listas, álbumes y saltar canciones en todos los altavoces.", "Installez Music Assistant et son intégration pour les playlists, albums et le saut de titres sur toutes les enceintes.", "Installa Music Assistant e la sua integrazione per playlist, album e salto brani su ogni altoparlante.", "Music Assistant と連携を入れると、すべてのスピーカーでプレイリスト・アルバム・スキップが使えます。", "Music Assistant와 통합을 설치하면 모든 스피커에서 재생목록, 앨범, 건너뛰기를 쓸 수 있어요.", "Installeer Music Assistant en de integratie voor afspeellijsten, albums en overslaan op elke speaker.", "Instale o Music Assistant e a integração para playlists, álbuns e pular faixas em todas as caixas."],
